    "summary": "Added actual coordinator recovery/native dispatch at a measured exactly-64MiB admission with maximum-size feedback, real checkpoint persistence/consolidation and reload. The same initial durable fixture plus one historical byte rejects through coordinator recovery, persists checkpoint_capacity, invokes no provider and preserves zero new unit/action charges; a fresh coordinator observes failed. Current mutable observer/dispatch metadata is reserved at encoded upper bounds rather than double-counted at changing instantaneous sizes. All 98 design-review tests and TypeScript pass.",
